      "title": "开放世界多智能体环境中的自主数学发现",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.23691",
      "primary_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.23691",
      "source": "Hacker News 热门（buzzing.cc 中文翻译）",
